WEBVTT

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:31.490
i smišljam zadatke za nas.

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:33.803
Tumarali smo od kuće do kuće

00:00:33.803 --> 00:00:37.170
tražeći muve zarobljene
u paukovim mrežama

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:39.557
i oslobađali smo ih.

00:00:39.557 --> 00:00:41.865
Četiri godine pre toga,
kad sam imala godinu dana,

00:00:41.865 --> 00:00:43.310
posle černobiljske katastrofe

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:45.641
padala je crna kiša,

00:00:45.641 --> 00:00:47.841
a sestrina kosa je opadala
u pramenovima

00:00:47.841 --> 00:00:50.398
i ja sam provela
devet meseci u bolnici.

00:00:50.398 --> 00:00:51.950
Nisu bile dozvoljene posete,

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:55.962
pa je mama potplatila radnika u bolnici.

00:00:55.962 --> 00:00:58.693
Nabavila je uniformu medicinske sestre

00:00:58.693 --> 00:01:03.038
i ušunjala se svake noći
da bi sedela pored mene.